<section id="registryHowTo" class="registry-howto" aria-labelledby="registryHowToHeading">
<h2 id="registryHowToHeading">How to use Action Registry</h2>
<p>Choose a task for written steps and an optional animated guide. The illustrations use fictional sample data and staged captures of the navy interface; they do not connect to Google or show actual account data. Your available controls depend on your access and setup.</p>
<p>Animations are hidden when reduced motion is requested. The written steps remain available.</p>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Find your workspace</summary><ol><li>Choose a workspace in the left navigation. Only workspaces permitted for your account appear.</li><li>Your selected filters and authorized scope affect the records shown.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Find your workspace" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Search and filter the dashboard</summary><ol><li>Use Search, site, KPI, status, owner, category and department filters to narrow the portfolio.</li><li>Use Reset to restore the available scope. Counts and reports follow the selected filters.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Search and filter the dashboard" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Loading, refresh and retry</summary><ol><li>Wait for the centered loading state to finish and check the current snapshot timestamp.</li><li>If a view reports a loading error, use its displayed retry control. If a save outcome is uncertain, contact the maintainer before repeating it.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Loading, refresh and retry" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Executive view and Full Report</summary><ol><li>Select Executive view or Screenshot Mode from the dashboard.</li><li>Choose Full Report for complete paginated detail; use Print this report when needed.</li><li>Owner fields are omitted in captures, but review free text before sharing.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Executive view and Full Report" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Register a new action plan</summary><ol><li>Choose New action. Complete scope, action, measurement, dates and review fields.</li><li>Select the matching category and type; describe concrete execution steps. Use the field guide in Readme for each field and conditional requirement.</li><li>Register for Approval submits a proposal; execution starts only after the required approval.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Register a new action plan" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Register a governance outcome</summary><ol><li>For a Standardization / Governance Projects action, choose Governance outcome when verifiable project criteria are appropriate instead of a direct numeric KPI.</li><li>Record the current problem, expected outcome, acceptance criteria and verification method, then complete the other required fields and submit for approval.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Register a governance outcome" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Save and resume a draft</summary><ol><li>Use Save registration draft to retain an unfinished registration for your own account.</li><li>Use Load my drafts to resume or delete it. Resuming replaces the current new-registration form; drafts are not submitted plans.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Save and resume a draft" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Review or revise a proposal</summary><ol><li>An eligible independent approver opens a pending proposal and reviews its scope, steps, target and dates.</li><li>Choose Approve Plan, Request Revision or Decline Plan; provide the required comment and save.</li><li>For material changes, an authorized owner uses Revise Plan. A revision creates a new version for approval.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Review or revise a proposal" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Update execution and attach proof</summary><ol><li>Under Submission &amp; Updates, select the current approved action. Owners enter permitted execution updates.</li><li>Upload appropriate proof before marking a plan Completed. Uploads require a configured, authorized evidence location.</li><li>Completing execution does not automatically validate effectiveness.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Update execution and attach proof" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Add leadership feedback</summary><ol><li>Select the action in Approvals &amp; Feedback and use Leadership Feedback.</li><li>Feedback is a separate record; it does not change approval, execution, performance or effectiveness.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Add leadership feedback" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Review weekly effectiveness</summary><ol><li>Use Weekly Effectiveness Review to see eligible actions needing review or data attention.</li><li>Open the action, confirm the observation period and document the impact, evidence and decision.</li><li>The weekly coverage view is separate from saved next-review dates and does not create a rating automatically.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Review weekly effectiveness" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Record an assessment and decision</summary><ol><li>Assessors with the required permission select an eligible current plan version.</li><li>Complete impact, observation period, evidence and next-decision sections. Explain the result supported by the evidence.</li><li>Validated, Partially Effective, No Observable Effect and Insufficient Evidence are distinct outcomes.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Record an assessment and decision" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Track follow-up commitments</summary><ol><li>Decision Follow-ups shows commitments and their current status within your authorized filters.</li><li>Open an item to record the permitted progress, completion, verification or other available follow-up action.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Track follow-up commitments" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Review scaling authorization</summary><ol><li>A scaling recommendation is separate from a governing authorization.</li><li>A configured, eligible governing approver can record a decision for permitted target scopes and conditions. No target plan or rollout is created automatically.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Review scaling authorization" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Inspect the timeline</summary><ol><li>Open Gantt to compare authorized action start and end dates.</li><li>Check date warnings before interpreting a missing or unusual timeline bar.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Inspect the timeline" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>My Work and saved scope history</summary><ol><li>Use My Work to open authorized plans and assigned follow-up work.</li><li>Saved scope history stores manual snapshots and compares matching account and filter scopes; it does not invent earlier history.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: My Work and saved scope history" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Enroll, modify or expire access</summary><ol><li>Administrators can enroll users and manage approved profile and access fields.</li><li>Choose New user or Edit, enter the approved details and reason, then preview the complete change before saving.</li><li>Set whole-account or temporary-grant expiry where appropriate. Deactivate or reactivate access through the Active setting; self-security and last-admin safeguards remain enforced.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Enroll, modify or expire access" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Transfer ownership</summary><ol><li>In Admin, use Owner handover to inspect plans within your authorized scope and select an eligible replacement owner.</li><li>A transfer creates a new plan version for approval. Historical proof is retained; follow-up assignments remain separate.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Transfer ownership" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Notifications and exception review</summary><ol><li>Authorized operators can review reminder controls and exceptions where configured.</li><li>Chat remains paused until its actual audience and configuration are approved. An uncertain send requires review rather than an unverified repeat.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Notifications and exception review" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<details class="registry-howto-topic"><summary>Readme and field explanations</summary><ol><li>Open Readme to search sponsor concepts and expand the relevant guidance.</li><li>Use the action-plan field guide for descriptions, conditional fields and examples.</li></ol><details class="registry-howto-animation"><summary>Show animated steps</summary><p class="registry-howto-motion-note">Animation hidden because reduced motion is enabled; follow the written steps above.</p><img class="registry-howto-motion" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="502" alt="Illustrated sample steps: Readme and field explanations" src="data:image/gif;base64,"></details></details>
<p>For installation, open the separate installation handoff in Readme. Setup, account permissions and live Google services require an authorized administrator.</p></section>
