            </tr>

            <tr class="readme-section-row">
              <td colspan="2">Dashboard Views</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td class="readme-term">Site Snapshot</td>
              <td>At-a-glance summary of Active, On Track, At Risk, Overdue, and Goal Met actions by site. Selecting a site filters the dashboard to that site.</td>
