            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td class="readme-term">Executive Narrative</td>
              <td>A short, automatically generated readout based only on the action plans currently in scope. It summarizes portfolio position, current-review-week updates, exceptions, and near-term deadlines without adding unsupported causes or recommendations.</td>
            </tr>

